  "prompt": "Build with plain JavaScript and no runtime dependencies. Keep the exact supplied v4 SVGs and intrinsic dimensions in a 240×168 native plane at (66,20) within the 372×264 stage. Preserve the complete original full view, copy, numeric datasets and dynamics in a 400×472 composition. Use shell playback, the primary action and Reset controls; extra tools belong in the full-view select or keyboard shortcuts. Drive original simulation steps with a fixed 60Hz pausable clock, retaining original model cadence, independent caller/viewport holds and chronological user input. Reset cancels older queued intent. Clean up every frame, listener, observer, capture and Canvas backing. Provide real keyboard focus, scaled pointer input, native vertical touch scrolling and complete offline exports. Reduced motion shows a static field; deliberate input uses the system 150ms opacity feedback. Native: preserve all ten supplied outlined 11px Geist Mono columns, their exact characters, colors, alpha and 14px leading. Loop two unchanged copies per 140px column using unwrapped displacement from the original seeded speed and wrap model. Use the original 34px aperture and 32px feather for pointer parting. Native G switches to dynamically drawn original Kana glyphs; keep original offsets, frame cadence, eleven-glyph tails and supplied column positions. Full: retain the complete original responsive columns, both original character sets, 12px font, 17px row pitch, 187px tail wrap, original seed and drawing function. Move or arrows aim, G changes glyphs, Escape releases, Space pauses/steps and R resets.",
